Then call sites: `mergeState.isMergeInProgress(runGitCommand, null)` — wait, but what about `workingDir`? mergeState.isMergeInProgress(runCommand, workingDir) passes workingDir as second arg to runCommand. runGitCommand ignores it. cli_execute_command without workingDirectory runs in job root cwd — same as the old local probe. Good.

Where to put the wrapper — I could keep a local helper `isMergeInProgress()` that delegates:

```js
